:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Pastry Cat (Enemy)]]. Not to be confused with [[Lieutenant Cat (Special Cat)]].''
'''Samurai Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]] and can be purchased for 90 [[Cat Food]] in the [[Upgrade Menu]] after completing [[Nepal (Empire of Cats)|Nepal/Yamaguchi]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. In [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]], [[True Form]] grants chance to slow non-[[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], it is obtainable in [[Dubai (Empire of Cats)|Hiroshima]] in Chapter 2 and costs 11000 XP. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he is unlocked from beating Nepal in the Empire of Cats chapter and costs 45 Cat Food.

