==Talents==
''Accessible at level '''30'''''
*'''[[Barrier Breaker]]''': Adds a 2% chance to break barriers, improves by 2% per level up to 20% (Total Cost: 165 NP)
*'''[[Weaken]]''': Adds a 10% chance to weaken non-Metal enemies to 50% for 24f <sup>0.8s</sup>, improves by 4f <sup>0.13s</sup> per level up to 60f <sup>2s</sup> (Total Cost: 165 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Resist|Resist Slow]]''': Reduces slow duration by 16%, improves by 6% per level up to 70% (Total Cost: 125 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|HP Buff]]''': Upgrades health by 8% per level up to 80% (Total Cost: 125 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|Attack Buff]]''': Upgrades attack power by 8% per level up to 80% (Total Cost: 125 NP)

